title: =(leaves N OBJECT...)= -- on every viewnode that names leaves
pid: c9bccbf1-f375-4a0f-9527-6ea07db5f8c9
body: |2-
  It gives the OBJECTs that name some leaf there: =node= and/or =rel= on
  a vognode or ghost, =rel= on a changeset marker, none where a bare
  request names a single leaf. N is how many distinct leaves a request
  naming all of them touches. What each object names is under "The
  processed requests" below. A request may also name =node= on a
  changeset marker, which this fact never lists, since the members
  drawn beside the marker show those leaves. The clients read it to build
  their requests and to count the leaves an unmark touches.
